@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:product] app-is-named-inventory
Everything a person reads MUST call the app Inventory: the launcher label ("Inventory", or
"Inventory dev" for the debug build), screens, sheets, the share sheet, notifications and
messages. Internal names MUST stay as they are, because changing them breaks phones that
already have the app or their saved settings: the applicationId com.octaviantocan.mymind,
the signing key, the update channel, preference keys such as the "thymind" theme id, and
WorkManager job names. Source: Tavi, 5 November 2026 ("let's fully rename it to Inventory
everywhere").

@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:product;privacy;architecture] usage-events-stay-apart
The app MUST record its own usage (coming to the front, the page shown, cards opened,
searches with their words, card actions, shares, pinch counts) through `data/Analytics.kt`
only, and send it to `POST /app/v1/events` (`docs/analytics.md`). These events MUST stay
out of the outbox and the library copy: a capped queue of their own, oldest dropped first,
wiped at sign-out, dropped when the server answers stop, and never stopping or slowing the
app when they cannot be sent. The app MUST NOT mention them, and there is no switch.
Source: Tavi, 5 November 2026, the analytics brief: "Everything, card ids too", "Not
mentioned", and "Build it, server first".
